---
/**
 * Shown on every page of a build that has not passed the launch gate. The text
 * holds for any such build: it says what may be unfinished, not what is.
 */
---

<div class="preview-banner" role="note">
  <p class="container">
    <b>Preview.</b> This site is not launched yet. Pages, ThunderID status checks and demo recordings may be unfinished; a
    chip marked “To verify” has not been checked against a ThunderID release.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .preview-banner {
    background: var(--status-partial-bg);
    color: var(--status-partial-fg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  p {
    padding-block: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
</style>
